  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nX : Y = 4 : 5\n\nY : Z = 5 : 7\n\nZ : W = 7 : 9\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ (X)/(Y)=(4)/(5) → (1)\n\n⇒ (Z)/(Y)=(7)/(5) → (2)\n\n⇒ Dividing (1) by (2), we get\n\n⇒ (frac{X)/(Y)}{(Z)/(Y)}=(frac{4)/(5)}{(7)/(5)}\n\n⇒ (X)/(Z)=(4)/(7) → (3)\n\n⇒ (W)/(Z)=(9)/(7) → (4)\n\n⇒ Dividing (3) by (4), we get\n\n⇒ (frac{X)/(Z)}{(W)/(Z)}=(frac{4)/(7)}{(9)/(7)}\n\n⇒ (X)/(W)=(4)/(9)\n\n**Therefore, the ratio X : W is equal to 4 : 9**",
